#. La colonne du focus contient le numéro du paquet. On le
#. qualifie pour que l'annonce commence par un mot plutôt que
#. par un chiffre nu ; le test évite de mal nommer une colonne
#. dont l'utilisateur aurait changé l'ordre.
#. Translators: %s is the packet number in the packet list.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:391
#, python-format
msgid "frame %s"
msgstr "trame %s"


#. Translators: description of the capture start/stop command.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:840
msgid "Start or stop the capture, and report the new state"
msgstr "Démarre ou arrête la capture, et annonce le nouvel état"


#. Translators: reported when a capture has started.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:927
msgid "Capture started"
msgstr "Démarrage de la capture"


#. Translators: reported when a capture has stopped.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:930
msgid "Capture stopped"
msgstr "Capture arrêtée"


#. Translators: description of the command reporting the capture state.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:934
msgid "Report whether a capture is running"
msgstr "Annonce si une capture est en cours"


#. Translators: reported when Wireshark does not expose the capture state.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:942
msgid "Capture state unavailable"
msgstr "État de la capture indisponible"


#. Translators: reported when a capture is currently running.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:946
msgid "Capture running"
msgstr "Capture en cours"


#. Translators: description of the row reading command.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:954
msgid "Read the current row column by column"
msgstr "Lit la ligne courante colonne par colonne"


#. Translators: reported when the command is used outside a list with columns.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:968
msgid "This command works in a list with columns"
msgstr "Cette commande s'utilise dans une liste en colonnes"


#. Translators: reported when the row holds no readable data.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:977
msgid "No readable data on this row"
msgstr "Aucune donnée lisible sur cette ligne"


#. Translators: description of a diagnostic command.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:983
msgid "Log the state of the Wireshark commands"
msgstr "Relève dans le journal l'état des commandes de Wireshark"


#. Translators: reported when the Wireshark window cannot be found.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:991
msgid "Wireshark window not found"
msgstr "Fenêtre de Wireshark introuvable"


#. Translators: confirms that the report has been written to the log.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:1006
msgid "Command report written to the log"
msgstr "Relevé des commandes écrit dans le journal"


#. Translators: description of a diagnostic command.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:1010
msgid "Log the accessibility information of the focused object"
msgstr "Journalise les informations d'accessibilité de l'objet ayant le focus"


#. Translators: confirms that the report has been written to the log.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:1016
msgid "Focus report written to the log"
msgstr "Relevé du focus écrit dans le journal"


#. Translators: description of a diagnostic command.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:1020
msgid "Log the accessibility information of the navigator object"
msgstr "Journalise les informations d'accessibilité de l'objet navigateur"


#. Translators: confirms that the report has been written to the log.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:1026
msgid "Navigator object report written to the log"
msgstr "Relevé de l'objet navigateur écrit dans le journal"


#. Translators: description of a diagnostic command.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:1030
msgid "Toggle logging of accessibility events"
msgstr "Active ou désactive la journalisation des événements d'accessibilité"


#. Translators: reported when event logging has been enabled.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:1037
msgid "Event logging enabled"
msgstr "Journalisation des événements activée"


#. Translators: reported when event logging has been disabled.
#: addon\appModules\wireshark.py:1040
msgid "Event logging disabled"
msgstr "Journalisation des événements désactivée"


#. Translators: user visible name of the add-on.
#: buildVars.py:17
msgid "Wireshark Accessibility"
msgstr "Accessibilité de Wireshark"


#. Translators: long description of the add-on.
#: buildVars.py:19
msgid ""
"Makes the Wireshark graphical interface usable with a screen reader.\n"
"Wireshark splits every row of its interface and packet lists into one cell "
"per\n"
"column, and puts focus on a cell holding no useful text: rows are now "
"announced\n"
"with their real content and their position in the list. Buttons with no\n"
"accessible name are announced using their tooltip, and the links of the "
"welcome\n"
"page, previously silent, are announced. Ctrl+E reports the start and the "
"stop of\n"
"a capture, which Wireshark signals by no accessibility event at all.\n"
"Capture data is never written to the NVDA log."
msgstr ""
"Rend l'interface graphique de Wireshark utilisable au lecteur d'écran.\n"
"Wireshark découpe chaque ligne de sa liste d'interfaces et de sa liste de\n"
"paquets en une cellule par colonne, et pose le focus sur une cellule sans texte\n"
"utile : les lignes sont désormais annoncées avec leur contenu réel et leur\n"
"position dans la liste. Les boutons sans nom accessible sont annoncés grâce à\n"
"leur infobulle, et les liens de la page d'accueil, jusqu'ici muets, sont\n"
"annoncés.\n"
"Ctrl+E annonce le démarrage et l'arrêt de la capture, que Wireshark ne signale\n"
"par aucun événement d'accessibilité.\n"
"Aucune donnée de capture n'est écrite dans le journal de NVDA."


#. Translators: what's new in this version.
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid ""
"First release.\n"
"The capture interface list and the packet list are announced with their\n"
"content and their position. Buttons without an accessible name use their\n"
"tooltip. The links on the welcome page are announced. Ctrl+E reports the "
"start\n"
"and the stop of a capture. Meaningless row and column numbers are no longer\n"
"announced in single column trees, such as the packet detail tree.\n"
"Diagnostic recordings redact capture data, and the diagnostic commands have "
"no\n"
"shortcut assigned by default."
msgstr ""
"Première version.\n"
"La liste des interfaces de capture et la liste des paquets sont annoncées avec\n"
"leur contenu et leur position. Les boutons sans nom accessible utilisent leur\n"
"infobulle. Les liens de la page d'accueil sont annoncés. Ctrl+E annonce le\n"
"démarrage et l'arrêt de la capture. Les numéros de ligne et de colonne\n"
"dépourvus de sens ne sont plus annoncés dans les arborescences à une seule\n"
"colonne, dont celle des détails du paquet.\n"
"Les relevés de diagnostic masquent les données de capture, et les commandes de\n"
"diagnostic n'ont aucun raccourci attribué par défaut."
